with chamaleon purple flakes and reflective glitter.",["https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0542/9968/9149/files/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_72b4acb5-347f-4081-a275-45e5c33b7a7e.jpg?v=1758319573","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0542/9968/9149/files/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_593021e0-fc11-4f63-9619-26265c48aa36.jpg?v=1758319573","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0542/9968/9149/files/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_efa11ac8-13e9-4f9a-b1bc-d74e1ceaf359.jpg?v=1758319573"]],"340008":[null,[]],"340009":[null,[]],"340010":[null,[]],"340011":[null,[]],"340012":[null,[]],"340013":[null,[]],"340014":["This is a mystery bag. If you have some polishes that you don't want to receive, please let us know (max of 2 colors to not be included). May Contain Bugs and hisses Wonder Angel in Disguise Erythrocytes Just One More Don't Be Afraid",["https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0542/9968/9149/products/20210920_100816.jpg?v=1632143962"]],"340015":["This is the second polish in this series. I lost a dear person that lived far away, an aunt that was very close to my heart. I was not able to see her in the last 2 years and that was so heavy on me. I had all the feelings of sadness, but specially that I could have done better. I could have sent more messages, more video calls, showed her my love for her. I want that all my polishes sent a positive and powerful message that we can live our lives showing love and care to our friends and family. The time to do that starts today. Friends & Family has a cloudy base that shifts from violet to red mixed with chameleon flakes black to blue.",["https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0542/9968/9149/files/IMG-5345.jpg?v=1725116630","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0542/9968/9149/files/IMG-5334.jpg?v=1725116630","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0542/9968/9149/files/IMG-20240821-WA0055.jpg?v=1725116629","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0542/9968/9149/files/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_99cfa3bf-1bc8-4f3f-9d54-c7a5cc110aa7.jpg?v=1723892387","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/