t.",["https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0542/9968/9149/files/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_99458994-d42b-4810-b61c-b3e1fe3d5f59.jpg?v=1755000549","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0542/9968/9149/files/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_06997686-14b3-476c-baf3-7b6d4978a2e4.jpg?v=1755000550","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0542/9968/9149/files/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_a688afb1-6b69-4cdc-8a20-d93aec330613.jpg?v=1755000549","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0542/9968/9149/files/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_87edcafd-2010-4daa-8f7c-3669f070fef9.jpg?v=1755000660","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0542/9968/9149/files/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_f5097373-e47d-45c3-bfc2-877dc225a2db.jpg?v=1755000659","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0542/9968/9149/files/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_db9090f6-4c20-472f-bb7a-60461bac1ab3.jpg?v=1755000659","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0542/9968/9149/files/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_d7637b85-ad9c-4ff1-959a-c40f8c1dcf99.jpg?v=1755000659","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0542/9968/9149/files/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_02ff174d-c89a-4406-adaa-6fbe69e47662.jpg?v=1755000659","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0542/9968/9149/files/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_4190afda-05ce-4672-b69e-80e936d3487d.jpg?v=1755000747","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0542/9968/9149/files/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_01675fba-d888-44a9-96a7-38e1ae76b49a.jpg?v=1755000747"]],"340023":["Sometimes the world gets too harsh. So many unkind words are coming from sources that should be trustworthy but are not. A world that pushes us to react instead of being silent first, to have time to ponder. We need to seed the soil with Words of Kindness. Words of Kindness is a bright color, a mix of violet/gold/green magnetic, and a Multicolor powder in the same color range. This is a electric polish, and I promise you will feel energized wearing it.",["https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0542/9968/9149/files/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_d91be10a-0731-44e9-a02e-9d9457988176.jpg?v=1755001541","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/