rom purples, blues, pinks, golds and greens. It was inspired by JOMO the opposite of FOMO. I want to decide to choose Joy over Fear. To rejoice in the moments/things I have time/money to have than the ones I can't. https://www.washingtonpost.com/wellness/2024/01/04/fomo-jomo-joy-missing-out/",["https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0542/9968/9149/files/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_d1467dff-7732-45e5-8196-148bd2a9815f.jpg?v=1730482424","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0542/9968/9149/files/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_45223885-939a-4ced-8f44-2e09c8b7c5c6.jpg?v=1730482424","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0542/9968/9149/files/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_9d2c4415-c770-4466-9be9-b43be259a00e.jpg?v=1730482424","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0542/9968/9149/files/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_2a2ade8b-e1b6-4e66-86fc-f95ce2c1fbff.jpg?v=1730482424","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0542/9968/9149/files/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_b7f6de5b-13b1-4466-8510-8b5ff93e6d73.jpg?v=1730482424","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0542/9968/9149/files/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_d07f2074-f7d9-4e3d-89cb-c7f4ba9960ca.jpg?v=1730482424","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0542/9968/9149/files/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_4d8608e2-1954-4ffa-9568-c0a8c9403ca4.jpg?v=1730482423","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0542/9968/9149/files/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_80816468-a417-4310-942a-bdb1e8ca3014.jpg?v=1730482424","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0542/9968/9149/files/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_23febfbe-d275-4095-bb70-1f5f82a5b9be.jpg?v=1730482424","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0542/9968/9149/files/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_e1115fd1-ae2f-42e5-a581-8dbfa2fc7dc7.jpg?v=1730482424","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0542/9968/9149/files/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_12d04349-38d2-423b-a44c-53b3ca0f24a2.jpg?v=1730482424","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0542/9968/9149/files/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_8167e7c7-2c85-43db-b657-5c314ba12b4e.jpg?v=1730482424","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0542/9968/9149/files/rn-image_picker_l